sequenceDiagram
    title DSD — CU-165 Consultar El Historial De Choferes De Un Vehiculo
autonumber
participant CTRL as CarAssignmentsController
participant VSRV as VehicleAssignmentService
participant CREP as RepositoryCar
participant AREP as RepositoryVehicleAssignment

CTRL->>VSRV: historialDelVehiculo(id, distributorId, pagination)
activate VSRV
VSRV->>CREP: findOne(where car_id y distributor_id, withDeleted)
activate CREP
CREP-->>VSRV: Car o null
deactivate CREP
alt vehículo inexistente o de otra distribuidora
    VSRV-->>CTRL: NotFoundException
else vehículo del tenant, aunque esté dado de baja
    VSRV->>AREP: findAndCount(where car_id, relations car delivery delivery.user, order assigned_at DESC, take, skip)
    activate AREP
    AREP-->>VSRV: filas y total
    deactivate AREP
    VSRV-->>CTRL: filas y total
    CTRL->>CTRL: informarTotal(res, total) en X-Total-Count
    CTRL->>CTRL: filas.map(VehicleAssignmentMapper.toHistoryDto)
end
deactivate VSRV
